// Stamped by .github/workflows/prepare-release.yml on the release branch.
// Do not edit by hand.
//
// Rendered as the base layer's display-name, which both keyboards' displays
// show while on the base layer — that is the at-a-glance "which firmware is on
// this board?" indicator. See docs/multi-keyboard-plan.md §10.
//
// No "v" prefix: the Toucan2's nice!view Gem draws this in a monospace 21.6px
// font into 121px of usable width, so only 5 characters fit. The git tag and
// release branch keep the "v" — prepare-release.yml strips it here.
#define KEYMAP_VERSION "1.3.0"
